2a:["$","div","Do the people contacted know they are talking to an AI?",{"className":"py-6","children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"text-base font-semibold text-[var(--foreground)] sm:text-lg","children":"Do the people contacted know they are talking to an AI?"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"mt-2 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-strong)]","children":"Yes, and it is a legal requirement. Since 2 August 2026, Article 50 of the EU AI Act requires that anyone interacting with an AI system be informed of it. Our agents state it in the first message, stop for good when someone replies STOP, and hand the conversation to a person on request. This disclosure cannot be removed at a client's request: it is written into our terms of service."}]]}]
2b:["$","div","Is our data, and our prospects' data, protected?",{"className":"py-6","children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"text-base font-semibold text-[var(--foreground)] sm:text-lg","children":"Is our data, and our prospects' data, protected?"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"mt-2 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-strong)]","children":"Yes. Your agent runs on dedicated infrastructure rather than shared software, and one client's data is never mixed with another's. A data processing agreement compliant with Article 28 of the GDPR is attached to the contract and signed as a matter of course."}]]}]
2c:["$","div","What if it does not suit us?",{"className":"py-6","children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"text-base font-semibold text-[var(--foreground)] sm:text-lg","children":"What if it does not suit us?"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"mt-2 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-strong)]","children":"You stop. There is no lock-in on the monthly fee: you tell us, the next month is not charged, and you keep what was produced, including your contact base. If you would rather talk to someone before committing to anything, call us on +33 7 71 48 76 98 and you will get us, not a support queue."}]]}]
